2
00:00:04,447 --> 00:00:06,547
<i>Back to school.</i>

3
00:00:06,835 --> 00:00:09,354
<i>Time to leave the carefree</i>
<i>memories of summer behind</i>

4
00:00:09,465 --> 00:00:11,280
<i>and buckle down</i>
<i>for another year.</i>

5
00:00:11,371 --> 00:00:12,360
Here we go again.

6
00:00:12,457 --> 00:00:15,679
Ugh. Do we have to?
I'm not ready.

7
00:00:16,087 --> 00:00:17,349
Can't we go back to June,

8
00:00:17,482 --> 00:00:20,190
when the whole summer was
stretched out in front of us?

9
00:00:20,308 --> 00:00:22,403
You got no memory
for pain, Frankie.

10
00:00:22,555 --> 00:00:24,091
You sure
you wanna go back there?

11
00:00:24,365 --> 00:00:27,152
Well, we were very hopeful
when it started.

12
00:00:27,985 --> 00:00:30,057
