I-I told them to go outside.

57
00:02:18,624 --> 00:02:20,411
Oh, my gosh.
You told them something,

58
00:02:20,504 --> 00:02:23,183
and they didn't do it?
Maybe those weren't our kids.

59
00:02:24,457 --> 00:02:25,739
I don't get it.

60
00:02:25,846 --> 00:02:28,154
When I was a kid, I ate supper
with one foot on the floor.

61
00:02:28,252 --> 00:02:29,687
I couldn't wait to get outside.

62
00:02:29,951 --> 00:02:31,639
And I didn't even need
any toys.

63
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,522
All I needed was a stick
and a rock.

64
00:02:33,633 --> 00:02:35,405
How do you think I got 'em
out of the garage?

65
00:02:36,396 --> 00:02:38,037
They really are pathetic, Mike.

66
00:02:38,167 --> 00:02:40,257
