88
00:03:26,402 --> 00:03:27,935
You didn't kill another pet,
did you?

89
00:03:28,094 --> 00:03:30,037
No, I don't even have
a pet right now.

90
00:03:30,205 --> 00:03:31,645
Do I?

91
00:03:32,303 --> 00:03:33,641
I'm planting a tomato.

92
00:03:34,144 --> 00:03:35,177
That's weird.

93
00:03:35,289 --> 00:03:36,505
I found it in my backpack.

94
00:03:36,604 --> 00:03:38,758
- Oh, that's much more normal then.
- I must've left it in there

95
00:03:38,881 --> 00:03:40,891
from when we were learning
about photosynthesis.

96
00:03:40,992 --> 00:03:42,827
Ah! That sounds like
a school word, Brick.

97
00:03:42,923 --> 00:03:44,380
