And we've come up
with a fun summer thing

101
00:03:53,458 --> 00:03:54,713
for the whole family.

102
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:55,586
Adoption?

103
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:56,683
Just say the word.

104
00:03:56,848 --> 00:03:58,214
Look, we've been watching
you three,

105
00:03:58,346 --> 00:04:00,420
