- and them mom makes us share.
- I want my own fries!

113
00:04:15,341 --> 00:04:17,555
No, not a drive-thru,
you fools.

114
00:04:17,649 --> 00:04:20,086
We're talking about
a drive-in movie.

115
00:04:20,179 --> 00:04:21,450
Movie! They're letting us
watch a movie!

116
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:24,073
No. Stop.
Nobody's going inside.

117
00:04:24,179 --> 00:04:26,282
Your mom and I are taking you
to a fun summer thing,

118
00:04:26,393 --> 00:04:27,475
and it's only 2 bucks a car,

119
00:04:27,585 --> 00:04:29,499
and it's called
a drive-in movie.

120
00:04:29,608 --> 00:04:31,154
Is that like the ride
at Disney World

121
00:04:31,269 --> 00:04:32,859
