in the movie?

122
00:04:32,967 --> 00:04:34,093
We're going to Disney World?!

123
00:04:34,198 --> 00:04:37,465
Nobody's going to Disney World.
Nobody's in the movie.

124
00:04:37,592 --> 00:04:41,851
Ugh. It's about giving
you people some... this.

125
00:04:42,575 --> 00:04:44,321
They have no appreciation
of "this."

126
00:04:44,414 --> 00:04:45,370
I don't get it.

127
00:04:45,465 --> 00:04:46,719
Why would we drive somewhere
to watch a movie

128
00:04:46,827 --> 00:04:48,464
when we can just
watch a movie here?

129
00:04:48,596 --> 00:04:50,774
