137
00:05:04,910 --> 00:05:06,748
Do you guys get this?
I-I don't get it.

138
00:05:06,850 --> 00:05:10,079
There's nothing to get.
Your dad and I were talking--

139
00:05:10,183 --> 00:05:11,788
