was fun when we were younger.

143
00:05:18,450 --> 00:05:19,859
Oh, no. Here it comes.

144
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,774
More tales of
life on the prairie.

145
00:05:21,894 --> 00:05:23,635
Fine. You win.
We'll play tennis.

146
00:05:23,747 --> 00:05:25,201
And I'll stay here
with my tomato.

147
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,153
To-mah-to.

148
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:30,021
Nobody stays. Everybody,
put on your shoes and let's go.

149
00:05:30,128 --> 00:05:31,794
Or you could put on your PJs.

150
00:05:31,963 --> 00:05:33,375
What?

151
00:05:33,471 --> 00:05:34,768
'Cause you'll be in the car.

152
00:05:36,604 --> 00:05:38,281
I don't get it.
Why are we still in the car?

153
00:05:38,366 --> 00:05:40,400
- I thought we nixed that.
