<i>made just for them by...</i>

160
00:06:08,133 --> 00:06:10,910
<i>yeah, awesome parents who care.</i>

161
00:06:11,036 --> 00:06:12,508
Oh, boy.

162
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:13,781
Ooh! Check this out.

163
00:06:15,105 --> 00:06:17,446
