182
00:06:52,927 --> 00:06:54,790
Axl, switch with me.
I can't see behind dad.

183
00:06:54,899 --> 00:06:57,298
- Pfft. - Axl, I think you're
gonna really like "Serpico."

184
00:06:57,417 --> 00:06:58,624
It's got Pacino in it.
Remember the coach

185
00:06:58,738 --> 00:07:00,946
- from "Any Given Sunday"?
- Oh, yeah? Cool.

186
