choosing between two schools.

197
00:07:22,567 --> 00:07:25,191
- I know, for Axl. - Dad, I am not
gonna be able to see when I'm behind you.

198
00:07:27,034 --> 00:07:27,976
Dad! Dad! Dad! Dad! Dad!

199
00:07:28,073 --> 00:07:30,489
- Guys, I'm trying to listen to
what they're saying. - Axl, switch with me!

200
