go on and on about football.

218
00:08:23,854 --> 00:08:25,412
Well, that's
'cause I'm his favorite.

219
00:08:26,059 --> 00:08:29,212
What? You are not
dad's favorite, Axl.

220
00:08:29,331 --> 00:08:30,527
Okay.

221
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,473
