228
00:08:42,938 --> 00:08:44,310
Yeah, but I have a really good
feeling about it.

229
00:08:45,099 --> 00:08:47,140
See? You think parents
don't have a favorite kid?

230
00:08:47,282 --> 00:08:48,982
Everybody has
a favorite everything,

231
00:08:49,092 --> 00:08:51,408
